<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
	<meta charset="UTF-8">
	<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
	<title>About | Article Blog</title>
	<link rel="stylesheet" href="/public/css/style.css">
</head>
<body>
	<app-header></app-header>
	<main class="container">
		<h1>About Article Blog</h1>
		<section class="about-content">
			<p>Article Blog is a demonstration project built with Clean Framework.</p>
			<p>It showcases the framework's capabilities for building modern web applications:</p>
			<ul>
				<li>File-based routing with automatic discovery</li>
				<li>Reusable component architecture</li>
				<li>Server-side rendering</li>
				<li>RESTful API endpoints</li>
			</ul>
		</section>
	</main>
	<app-footer></app-footer>
</body>
</html>
